    "sentence_translations": [
      "Cross-border E-Commerce Companies Springing up in China",
      "",
      "Chinese people’s passion for shopping while abroad undoubtedly is no news for many foreigners.",
      "However, not everyone has the opportunity to go abroad.",
      "Thus emerged the industry of people reselling imported products on Wechat and Taobao, ..",
      ".. which resulted in decreased customer rights and generated problems for companies maintaining their public reputation.",
      "Many local governments have recognized the problems but at the same time smelled the business opportunities.",
      "The governments understood restrictions would be of little use.",
      "Instead, they took the opportunity to establish multiple cross-border E-commerce platforms, ..",
      ".. supplying the needs for the public and boosting the local economies.",
      "The most popular items to buy on the platforms are mom and baby products, cosmetics and healthcare products.",
      ""
    ]
  }
